# Context budget

- **Mode A:** simple Q&A — no vault bootstrap
- **Vault reads:** native `Read`/`Grep` on `D:\Obsidian\...`
- **Vault writes:** native `Write`/`StrReplace` — MCP only per `obsidian-vault-io.mdc`
- **Harness:** `npm run audit:facts` when verifying limits or before publish
- One tool per vault file per turn
